{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "歌手观众全被困住了  (Singers and Audience Stranded in the Storm)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "crew": "场务",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Less than three hours before Twelve Singers goes live, Lin Jie, Qin Xiao, and the studio crew discover that floodwaters have trapped the host, guest performers, all seven finalists, and the entire studio audience—while rival show Supernova starts airing early. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "明星团队已经被困在机场了，不能连个主持人都没有了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "别说他们了，观众一个都没到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "什么？歌手全都到不了了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这七个歌手和助演团队坐同一辆大巴过来，他们现在在一块高地上躲着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "不到三个小时，开什么玩笑啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，超新星开始直播了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他们提前开始热场了，学的我们，从嘉宾出发、观众入场，还有往期花絮回顾，全部都播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那边是广西风景区，天气很好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "要是我们延迟到以后再播的话，估计这一期的收视率就完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，台里电话，现在怎么弄都是大麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "明星团队已经被困在机场了，不能连个主持人都没有了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The celebrity guests are already stranded at the airport—we cannot end up without even a host!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "别说他们了，观众一个都没到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind them—not a single audience member has made it here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "什么？歌手全都到不了了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? None of the competing singers can get here either?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这七个歌手和助演团队坐同一辆大巴过来，他们现在在一块高地上躲着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All seven singers and their backing band rode the same coach and are sheltering on high ground right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "不到三个小时，开什么玩笑啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Less than three hours to airtime—what kind of joke is this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，超新星开始直播了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, Supernova has already started broadcasting live!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他们提前开始热场了，学的我们，从嘉宾出发、观众入场，还有往期花絮回顾，全部都播。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They started warming up early, copying our format—airing guest departures, audience arrivals, and past highlights.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那边是广西风景区，天气很好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Their venue is at a scenic resort with clear skies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "要是我们延迟到以后再播的话，估计这一期的收视率就完了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we postpone the finale to another day, our ratings for this episode are finished.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，台里电话，现在怎么弄都是大麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, the network is on the line—every option we have right now is a disaster.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
